      "writtenOn": "2020-12-14T21:07:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Using -\u003ei_verity_info is error-prone because a different struct is supposed to be stored in it.   A field in the incfs-specific portion of the inode should be used instead, to avoid two incompatible uses of the same field.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 193,
