        "id": 1137063
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-14T21:07:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There\u0027s no need to copy the signature into the fsverity_descriptor, as incfs doesn\u0027t use fsverity_descriptor as an on-disk format.",
