      "writtenOn": "2020-12-14T21:07:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This doesn\u0027t make sense, as there is no \"verity in progress\" flag anymore.\n\nIt looks like this was copied from fs/verity/ but not updated to take into account the way that incfs does things.\n\nIt seems that this ioctl doesn\u0027t build the Merkle tree on incfs.  So we don\u0027t have to worry about holding the inode lock for too long, so we should just hold it the whole time.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 232,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 241,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "058de0817feded3fdd24c81da2d25f4e273e2dd7",
